(41, NULL, 'Dr Vani Yepuri', 'dr-vani-yepuri', 'doctors/20062698-2ef4-40e4-bd63-185a6b35c991.webp', 'MBBS, MD - Dermatology', 'Consultant Dermatologist', '93598', 'Uttarahalli', 17, 'Dr. Vani Yepuri is a Consultant Dermatologist with over three years of experience in clinical dermatology and aesthetic practice. She consults at Nano Hospital in Uttarahalli, Bangalore. She has a special interest in Aesthetic Dermatology and performs a wide range of procedures including laser treatments, Botox, fillers, chemical peels, and vitiligo surgeries.\n\nShe completed her MBBS from Rangaraya Medical College, Kakinada (2001–2007), followed by Postgraduate training in Dermatology, Venereology & Leprology (DDVL) from Rangaraya Medical College, Kakinada (2009–2011). She further pursued a Fellowship in Medical Cosmetology from Venkat Charmalaya Centre for Advanced Dermatology under Rajiv Gandhi University of Health Sciences, Bangalore (2012–2013).', 13, '2026-02-02 14:24:28', '2026-02-17 07:03:53'),
(42, NULL, 'Dr Sharath C T', 'dr-sharath-c-t', 'doctors/ed7c6460-2760-4e95-8924-f7d37a0c4ecd.webp', 'MBBS, MS - Urology', 'Consultant Urologist', '95039', 'Uttarahalli', 14, 'Dr. Sharath C T is a Urologist in Bangalore with 14 years of experience in this field. He is a Consultant at Nano Hospital in Uttarahalli, Bangalore. He completed his MBBS from Hassan Institute of Medical Sciences in 2012, MS in General Surgery from Coimbatore Medical College in 2016, and DNB in Urology/Genito-Urinary Surgery from the National Board of Examination, India in 2020', 8, '2026-02-02 14:25:23', '2026-02-17 07:06:20'),
(43, NULL, 'Dr Sanjay R P', 'dr-sanjay-r-p', 'doctors/2d3c776e-83a1-4fde-a866-f0b099964eb0.webp', 'MBBS, MS - Urology', 'Consultant Urologist', '49790 ', 'Uttarahalli', 28, 'Dr. Sanjay R P is a Urologist and Andrologist in Bangalore with 28 years of experience in these fields. He is a Consultant at Nano Hospital in Uttarahalli, Bangalore. He completed his MBBS from Mahadevappa Rampure Medical College, Gulbarga in 1998, MS in General Surgery from Bangalore Medical College and Research Institute, Bangalore in 2004, and MCh in Urology from the Institute of Nephro Urology in 2015.', 8, '2026-02-02 14:27:50', '2026-05-21 10:34:53'),
(47, NULL, 'Dr Kishan Rao K', 'dr-kishan-rao-k', 'doctors/f2703222-f5bf-4827-b54c-0743ff40bd26.webp', 'MBBS, DNB (Ortho), MS (Ortho), MNAMS, PBFHS', ' Consultant orthopaedic and Hand surgeon', '63912', 'Hulimavu', 13, 'Dr. Kishan Rao is a specialized Hand Surgeon with advanced training in orthopaedics and hand surgery. He is a Consultant at Nano Hospital in Uttarahalli, Bangalore. He is a double postgraduate in Orthopaedics from the prestigious Christian Medical College, Vellore, and pursued his subspecialization at the Dr. Paul Brand Center for Hand Surgery.\nDr. Rao has also been deputed to train government Orthopaedic and Plastic Surgeons in Bhubaneswar, where he demonstrated various techniques for correction of leprosy paralytic deformities. He is committed to delivering the highest standards of care, actively participates in seminars and conferences, and has published and presented multiple academic papers.', 1, '2026-02-02 14:32:54', '2026-04-09 12:31:34'),
(48, NULL, 'Dr Manohar Babu', 'dr-manohar-babu', NULL, 'MBBS, MS - Orthopaedics', 'Consultant Orthopaedics Surgeon', '61141', 'Hulimavu', NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-02-02 14:33:58', '2026-02-02 14:33:58'),
(49, NULL, 'Dr Amith Shetty P', 'dr-amith-shetty-p', 'doctors/49f63e63-6065-4777-a6e6-9f2af49d4102.webp', 'MBBS, MS - Orthopaedics', 'Consultant Trauma and Joint Replacement Surgeon', '86086', 'Hulimavu', 17, 'Dr. Amith Shetty  is an Orthopaedic Surgeon with specialized training in Hip and Knee Arthroplasty. He is a Consultant at Nano Hospitals in Hulimavu, Bangalore. He completed his MBBS from K.S. Hegde Medical College, Mangalore, Karnataka, and his MS in Orthopaedics from JJM Medical College, Davangere, Karnataka. He also holds the SICOT Diploma (Orthopaedics) from the International Society of Orthopaedic Surgery and Traumatology.', 1, '2026-02-02 14:35:26', '2026-02-17 09:14:21'),
(50, NULL, 'Dr Raghavendra D Rao', 'dr-raghavendra-d-rao', 'doctors/618eff0f-b57e-46e6-b2d8-96f4c15b4407.webp', 'MBBS, MS - Orthopaedics', 'Consultant orthopaedic spine surgeon', '61474', 'Hulimavu', 30, 'Dr. Raghavendra M S is an Orthopaedist, Joint Replacement Surgeon, Arthroscopic Surgeon, and Traumatology Specialist with 20 years of experience in these fields. He is a Consultant at Nano Hospitals in Hulimavu, Bangalore. Over the years, he has worked at several major hospitals in Bangalore, gaining extensive experience in advanced orthopaedic care.\n\nHe completed his MBBS with 6th Rank from Jagadguru Jayadeva Murugarajendra Medical College (JJMMC) in 1997, followed by MS in Orthopaedics from Kasturba Medical College, Manipal in 2001. He further pursued a Fellowship in Joint Replacement from Christian Medical College & Hospital, Vellore in 2004. He has also attended international conferences and hands-on workshops on joint replacement and arthroscopic surgeries in Germany and Bangkok, enhancing his expertise in advanced orthopaedic techniques.', 1, '2026-02-02 14:37:35', '2026-04-09 12:31:12'),
(51, NULL, 'Dr Sudhindra Dharmavaram', 'dr-sudhindra-dharmavaram', 'doctors/8f62b367-c19f-43f9-bfa7-c3d07cb22b2a.webp', 'MBBS, MS - Orthopaedics', 'Consultant Orthopaedics Surgeon', '80575', 'Hulimavu', 18, 'Dr. Sudhindra Dharmavaram is a specialist in Pain Medicine and Interventional Pain Management. He is a Consultant at Nano Hospitals in Hulimavu, Bangalore. His expertise lies in comprehensive and multidimensional assessment of chronic pain and the execution of advanced interventional pain management techniques.', 1, '2026-02-02 14:38:44', '2026-05-21 10:29:31'),
(53, NULL, 'Dr Rakhi Sircar', 'dr-rakhi-sircar', 'doctors/6d4d0187-d57d-447e-a40e-ffb668e7dace.webp', 'MBBS, MS - Paediatrics', 'Consultant Paediatrician', '70253', 'Hulimavu', 33, 'Dr. Rakhi Sircar is a Pediatrician in Bangalore with 33 years of experience in this field. She is a Consultant at Nano Hospitals in Hulimavu, Bangalore. She completed her MBBS from Calcutta National Medical College in 1993, Diploma in Child Health (DCH) from Dr. B.C. Roy Memorial Hospital for Children, Kolkata in 2000, and DNB in Paediatrics from the National Board of Examination in 2003.', 2, '2026-02-02 14:41:38', '2026-02-17 07:37:07'),
(54, NULL, 'Dr Ramya K S', 'dr-ramya-k-s', 'doctors/65c18c10-d424-4709-a155-93f175bcdcc9.webp', 'MBBS, MS - Gynaecology', 'Consultant Gynecologist, Obstetrician and Laproscopic Surgeon', '88023', 'Both', 16, 'Dr. Ramya K S is a Gynecologist, Obstetrician, and Laparoscopic Surgeon in Bangalore with 16 years of experience in these fields. She is a Consultant at Nano Hospitals in Hulimavu, Bangalore and Nano Hospital in Uttarahalli, Bangalore. She completed her MBBS from Vijayanagara Institute of Medical Sciences (VIMS), Bellary in 2009, MS in Obstetrics & Gynaecology from St. John’s Medical College, Bangalore in 2014, and a Fellowship in Minimal Access Surgery from World Laparoscopy Hospital, Gurgaon (NCR), New Delhi in 2019.', 3, '2026-02-02 14:42:58', '2026-02-17 07:39:28'),
