(59, NULL, 'Dr Aparna Parvatikar', 'dr-aparna-parvatikar', 'doctors/d788cc97-d7ee-4cdd-a7c1-6b768c037c24.webp', 'MBBS, MD - General Medicine', 'Consultant Physician', '111160', 'Hulimavu', 7, 'Aparna Parvatikar is an expert and experienced General Physician doctor. Aparna Parvatikar specializes in General Physician. Currently, Aparna Parvatikar is practicing at Nano Hospitals | OPD Hulimavu, Bengaluru is fluent in english, and provides compassionate care for all the patients to ensure complete recovery. Aparna Parvatikar strives to provide advanced medical care in a comfortable and holistic environment for all patients coming for treatment.', 4, '2026-02-02 14:51:21', '2026-05-21 11:18:14'),
