(73, NULL, 'Dr Srinivas C', 'dr-srinivas-c', 'doctors/6cfa8802-cc55-47b2-aafb-7576bbc8efa3.webp', 'MBBS, MD - Rheumatology', 'Consultant Rheumatologist', '65685', 'Hulimavu', 23, 'Dr. Srinivasa Chennareddy is a DM-qualified Rheumatologist with expertise in the diagnosis and management of rheumatoid arthritis, ankylosing spondylitis, vasculitis, metabolic bone disorders, and osteoporosis. He is a Consultant at Nano Hospitals in Hulimavu, Bangalore, providing comprehensive rheumatologic care with a focus on evidence-based and patient-centered treatment approaches.', 17, '2026-02-02 15:11:05', '2026-05-21 12:29:45'),
(74, NULL, 'Dr A.S Sushrith Urs', 'dr-as-sushrith-urs', 'doctors/36ae2a4e-dab3-4abe-bbaf-a2d4cd28747c.webp', 'M.B.B.S, M.S General Surgery', ' General Surgeon ', '123348', 'Uttarahalli', 10, 'Dr. Sushrith URS is a General Surgeon in Bangalore with 10 years of overall experience, including 1 year as a specialist. His medical registration is verified. He is a Consultant at Nano Hospital in Uttarahalli, Bangalore and Nano Hospitals Uttarahalli in Chikkakallasandra, Bangalore. He completed his MBBS from Rajiv Gandhi University of Health Sciences in 2016 and MS in General Surgery from Dr. B. R. Ambedkar Medical College in 2023.', 20, '2026-02-03 06:38:40', '2026-05-21 13:00:54'),
(77, NULL, 'Dr. Sreedhara Murthy B N', 'dr-sreedhara-murthy-b-n', 'doctors/ffb79228-5527-4d2c-b6b5-7b05ba260e6d.webp', 'MBBS, MS - General Surgery, MCh - Pediatric Surgery', 'Consultant Paediatrician', '34836', 'Both', 33, 'Dr. B. N. Sreedhara Murthy is a highly experienced Paediatric Surgeon associated with Nano Hospitals, Uttarahalli and BG Road, Bengaluru, with over 33 years of overall medical experience, including 26 years of specialised expertise in paediatric surgery. He is known for his compassionate approach and advanced surgical care for infants, children, and adolescents across a wide range of paediatric conditions. Dr. Murthy has received several academic and non-academic recognitions throughout his career, including the prestigious President Award in Scouting presented by the Honourable President of India, Gyani Zail Singh, in 1984. He has also contributed extensively to the medical field through multiple publications and paper presentations in paediatric surgery', 2, '2026-05-08 06:08:09', '2026-05-08 06:28:37'),
(78, NULL, 'Dr. Krithika D Muralidhar', 'dr-krithika-d-muralidhar', 'doctors/36f29750-c62a-476c-a713-65c8fc2c051d.webp', 'MBBS, MD, MRCP (London),  DNB (Nephrology)', 'Consultant Nephrologist', '83201', 'Both', 11, 'Dr. KRITHIKA D. MURALIDHARA is a Doctor and has an experience of 11 years in this field. The doctor completed MBBS from Karnatak University in 2009', 26, '2026-05-12 09:48:47', '2026-05-12 09:48:47'),
(79, NULL, 'Dr Dhruva H M', 'dr-dhruva-h-m', 'doctors/32270292-df4f-4c4b-aa32-10725e150030.webp', 'MBBS,MS,DNB,MCh', 'Consultant Urologist', '117557', 'Both', 10, 'Dr. Dhruva H M is a Urologist in Uttarahalli, Bangalore and has an experience of 9 years in this field. Dr. Dhruva H M practices at Nano Hospital in Uttarahalli, Bangalore. He completed MBBS from Kempegowda institution of medical college in 2017,MS - General Surgery from kempegowda institution of medical science in 2021 and MCh - Urology from SHRI B M patel medical college vijayapura in 2025.', 8, '2026-05-12 09:53:25', '2026-05-12 09:55:17'),
(80, NULL, 'Dr kirthi kiran', 'dr-kirthi-kiran', 'doctors/e91f1303-3f9f-41c5-b623-9d53e0893653.webp', 'MBBS, MS', 'CONSULTANT ENT &HEAD NECK SURGEON', '112127', 'Hulimavu', 6, 'Dr. Kirthi Kiran is an experienced ENT Surgeon practicing at Nano Hospitals, BG Road branch, Hulimavu, Bengaluru. He specializes in the diagnosis and treatment of ear, nose, throat, head, and neck conditions using advanced medical and surgical techniques. Dr. Kirthi Kiran is known for providing patient-focused care with expertise in managing sinus disorders, throat infections, hearing problems, and ENT-related surgeries. He is committed to delivering comprehensive and effective treatment with a focus on long-term patient well-being.', 15, '2026-05-14 07:38:19', '2026-05-14 07:42:55'),
(81, NULL, 'Dr Sharan Achar T', 'dr-sharan-achar-t', 'doctors/c1538d8c-cad4-4d80-b0f4-6297b1941d9a.webp', 'MBBS, MS Ortho, DNB, FASSI, FAO', 'Consultant Orthopaedic Spine Surgeon', '109282', 'Both', 11, 'Dr. Sharan Achar T is an experienced Orthopedic Spine Surgeon practicing at Nano Hospitals. He specializes in the diagnosis and treatment of spine disorders, back pain, neck pain, slipped disc, spinal injuries, and degenerative spine conditions. Dr. Sharan Achar T completed his MBBS from Mysore Medical College and Research Institute in 2015, MS in Orthopaedics from The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University in 2019, and DNB in Orthopedics/Orthopedic Surgery from National Board of Examinations in 2019. He is known for providing patient-focused spine care using advanced orthopedic and minimally invasive treatment approaches.', 1, '2026-05-14 07:46:47', '2026-05-14 07:46:57');

